WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
<b><font color="#ff9019">JM Gacho Subs</font></b>

2
00:01:06,483 --> 00:01:08,652
{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>How did I survive that?</i></b></font>

3
00:01:10,946 --> 00:01:13,573
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It was some damn fall.</i></b></font>

4
00:01:13,574 --> 00:01:17,660
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Oh, shit. My comm's busted.</i></b></font>

5
00:01:17,661 --> 00:01:20,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>My thermal's busted too.</i></b></font>

6
00:01:21,707 --> 00:01:25,210
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I should have got snapped in half
and died on the way down,</i></b></font>

7
00:01:25,335 --> 00:01:28,588
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>instead of slowly turning
into a meat popsicle.</i></b></font>

8
00:01:30,549 --> 00:01:31,633
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Timo?</b></font>

9
00:01:33,427 --> 00:01:34,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Timo!</b></font>

10
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:38,724
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Timo, I'm down here.</b></font>

11
00:01:40,267 --> 00:01:42,269
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Ow.</b></font>

12
00:01:42,895 --> 00:01:44,146
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Timo.</b></font>

13
00:01:48,567 --> 00:01:49,943
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mickey?</b></font>

14
00:01:50,277 --> 00:01:51,486
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>T-- Timo!</b></font>

15
00:01:52,196 --> 00:01:55,449
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Timo, I'm down here.
- Mickey. Whoa.</b></font>

16
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:58,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You haven't died yet?</b></font>

17
00:01:58,452 --> 00:02:00,244
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- No.
- Hold on.</b></font>

18
00:02:10,714 --> 00:02:11,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, shit.</b></font>

19
00:02:12,925 --> 00:02:14,760
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Your flamethrower's still good.</b></font>

20
00:02:15,427 --> 00:02:16,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not a single scratch.</b></font>

21
00:02:17,888 --> 00:02:19,764
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's a good thing I thought
to come down here.</b></font>

22
00:02:19,765 --> 00:02:21,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Weapons will be happy to see this.</b></font>

23
00:02:21,683 --> 00:02:23,267
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, I'm gonna turn this in, okay?</b></font>

24
00:02:23,268 --> 00:02:24,895
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can take it.</b></font>

25
00:02:26,104 --> 00:02:28,857
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're not mad, right?
That I'm just taking this?</b></font>

26
00:02:29,733 --> 00:02:33,528
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I mean, it's not looking very good
for you, right?</b></font>

27
00:02:33,529 --> 00:02:37,866
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Also, line only goes this far.
- Uh-huh.</b></font>

28
00:02:39,034 --> 00:02:42,037
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, no, we-- we're cool.</b></font>

29
00:02:44,164 --> 00:02:45,999
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You shouldn't have to take the risk.</b></font>

30
00:02:47,167 --> 00:02:49,044
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah, that's what I'm saying.</b></font>

31
00:02:52,589 --> 00:02:55,133
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Plus, they're gonna reprint you
back out tomorrow anyway.</b></font>

32
00:02:57,094 --> 00:02:57,928
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

33
00:03:01,682 --> 00:03:02,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, Mickey.</b></font>

34
00:03:03,559 --> 00:03:04,393
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah?</b></font>

35
00:03:05,602 --> 00:03:07,437
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What's it feel like to die?</b></font>

36
00:03:12,359 --> 00:03:16,154
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm sure you're used to it by now.
Still...</b></font>

37
00:03:23,370 --> 00:03:25,288
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How many times is this?</b></font>

38
00:03:25,289 --> 00:03:27,207
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're Mickey... 16?</b></font>

39
00:03:28,542 --> 00:03:31,461
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>17. Jerk.</b></font>

40
00:03:32,754 --> 00:03:34,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>18 after this one.</b></font>

41
00:03:34,047 --> 00:03:37,550
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, it was nice knowing you,
have a nice death.</b></font>

42
00:03:37,551 --> 00:03:38,886
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>See you tomorrow.</b></font>

43
00:03:42,264 --> 00:03:43,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Oh, great.</i></b></font>

44
00:03:45,267 --> 00:03:47,144
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Why not?</i></b></font>

45
00:03:51,565 --> 00:03:54,067
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>That's a pretty big one.</i></b></font>

46
00:03:55,569 --> 00:03:58,029
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Hopefully, I'll just get swallowed
in one go.</i></b></font>

47
00:03:58,030 --> 00:04:01,407
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It's got to be better
than slowly freezing to death.</i></b></font>

48
00:04:01,408 --> 00:04:02,867
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I guess.</i></b></font>

49
00:04:20,761 --> 00:04:21,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Or maybe not.</i></b></font>

50
00:04:37,361 --> 00:04:39,445
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But they just
printed me out again</i></b></font>

51
00:04:39,446 --> 00:04:41,155
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>every time I died.</i></b></font>

52
00:04:41,156 --> 00:04:44,993
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>All my data is saved,
and I just get a whole new body.</i></b></font>

53
00:04:45,619 --> 00:04:49,539
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>They do all this, kind of,
regular uploads of memories</i></b></font>

54
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:51,791
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>and my personality traits...</i></b></font>

55
00:04:51,792 --> 00:04:56,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>...and re-implant it back in my brain.</i></b></font>

56
00:04:56,171 --> 00:04:58,339
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>That's some crazy technology, man.</i></b></font>

57
00:04:58,340 --> 00:05:01,551
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Let's just say it's-- it's advanced.</i></b></font>

58
00:05:01,552 --> 00:05:03,387
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It's very advanced.</i></b></font>

59
00:05:07,641 --> 00:05:10,351
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes.</b></font>

60
00:05:10,352 --> 00:05:11,978
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, come on, come on.</b></font>

61
00:05:11,979 --> 00:05:14,480
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wait. Would you just hold on a second?</b></font>

62
00:05:14,481 --> 00:05:16,399
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just like-- Calm down. Calm down.</b></font>

63
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:18,484
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just relax, breathe.
That's right, breathe.</b></font>

64
00:05:18,485 --> 00:05:19,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Oh!
- Yes!</b></font>

65
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:24,907
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The whole body printing
and memory transplanting thing,</i></b></font>

66
00:05:24,908 --> 00:05:28,452
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>to be honest, was so ridiculously
ahead of its time,</i></b></font>

67
00:05:28,453 --> 00:05:32,331
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>that it caused so many, like,
ethical fights</i></b></font>

68
00:05:32,332 --> 00:05:34,208
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>and religious blah, blah, blah,</i></b></font>

69
00:05:34,209 --> 00:05:37,171
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>that it was actually banned on Earth,</i></b></font>

70
00:05:37,296 --> 00:05:41,465
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>and they only allow it now
in outer space for Expendables.</i></b></font>

71
00:05:41,466 --> 00:05:43,009
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Like me.</i></b></font>

72
00:05:43,010 --> 00:05:44,969
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So, from the second
we left the atmosphere,</i></b></font>

73
00:05:44,970 --> 00:05:48,431
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>they made me work my ass off
all the way to this planet.</i></b></font>

74
00:05:48,432 --> 00:05:50,767
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Gave me one mission after another.</i></b></font>

75
00:05:51,894 --> 00:05:56,732
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, Tech, what's going on?
The extra cable's here already.</b></font>

76
00:05:57,399 --> 00:05:59,276
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Um, the thing is, Mickey...</i></b></font>

77
00:06:00,444 --> 00:06:02,362
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Hey, Medical, you wanna tell him?</i></b></font>

78
00:06:03,530 --> 00:06:05,072
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Tell me what?</b></font>

79
00:06:05,073 --> 00:06:06,866
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Hi, Mickey. How're you doing?</i></b></font>

80
00:06:06,867 --> 00:06:09,870
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Are you experiencing any vertigo,
nausea or dizziness?</i></b></font>

81
00:06:10,787 --> 00:06:14,373
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, I-I guess I am feeling
a little dizzy.</b></font>

82
00:06:14,374 --> 00:06:16,960
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It's only gonna get worse
from here, Mickey,</i></b></font>

83
00:06:17,085 --> 00:06:18,878
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>with a nice fever too.</i></b></font>

84
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:22,465
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Truth is, you're exposed to unthinkable
levels of radiation right now,</i></b></font>

85
00:06:22,466 --> 00:06:25,384
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>which is why we sent you out
in the first place.</i></b></font>

86
00:06:25,385 --> 00:06:26,636
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay.</b></font>

87
00:06:26,637 --> 00:06:28,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>If you could give us
a full description of your symptoms.</i></b></font>

88
00:06:28,931 --> 00:06:31,682
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So, a couple things I wanna go through</i></b></font>

89
00:06:31,683 --> 00:06:34,143
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>on our cosmic radiation checklist first.</i></b></font>

90
00:06:34,144 --> 00:06:37,313
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>How long until your skin starts to burn?</i></b></font>

91
00:06:37,314 --> 00:06:40,358
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Then, how long until you go blind?</i></b></font>

92
00:06:40,359 --> 00:06:42,777
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And of course, how long until you die?</i></b></font>

93
00:06:42,778 --> 00:06:46,156
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>That's the real nut we're after.</i></b></font>

94
00:06:48,951 --> 00:06:52,328
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>There was this one time
in my fourth grade science class,</i></b></font>

95
00:06:52,329 --> 00:06:54,665
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I messed with a lab frog.</i></b></font>

96
00:06:55,582 --> 00:06:58,502
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I just figured
this all must be my punishment.</i></b></font>

97
00:06:59,962 --> 00:07:02,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Mickey, take off your glove,</i></b></font>

98
00:07:02,005 --> 00:07:04,716
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>so I can see what's happening
under your space suit.</i></b></font>

99
00:07:15,769 --> 00:07:19,272
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Oh! Oh! Wow! Did you see that?</i></b></font>

100
00:07:46,925 --> 00:07:49,468
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Good morning.</b></font>

101
00:07:49,469 --> 00:07:51,345
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Keep yourself hydrated, Mickey.</b></font>

102
00:07:51,346 --> 00:07:53,431
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You'll start to feel extremely parched.</b></font>

103
00:07:53,432 --> 00:07:55,808
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Arkady, I think the dose was too high.</b></font>

104
00:07:55,809 --> 00:07:58,352
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Who cares, Dorothy?
He's gonna be dead in ten minutes.</b></font>

105
00:07:58,353 --> 00:08:00,104
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just focus on getting
all the blood samples.</b></font>

106
00:08:00,105 --> 00:08:02,816
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He's gonna bleed through his eyes,
nose, mouth, ears, and rectum.</b></font>

107
00:08:03,734 --> 00:08:07,403
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Make sure to collect separate samples
from every hole. Okay?</b></font>

108
00:08:07,404 --> 00:08:10,323
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And keep the memory upload going
at the same time.</b></font>

109
00:08:12,242 --> 00:08:14,452
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This Mickey's special,
you know that, right?</b></font>

110
00:08:14,453 --> 00:08:17,623
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Out of all the Mickeys,
you will have the shortest lifespan.</b></font>

111
00:08:18,582 --> 00:08:22,127
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- I heard. Ten minutes.
- Well--</b></font>

112
00:08:23,086 --> 00:08:26,756
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Actually, good news, it's more like 15.</b></font>

113
00:08:26,757 --> 00:08:29,675
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Much better, isn't it?</b></font>

114
00:08:29,676 --> 00:08:31,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I would have been
filthy rich by now</i></b></font>

115
00:08:31,553 --> 00:08:32,803
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>with life insurance, except...</i></b></font>

116
00:08:32,804 --> 00:08:36,766
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>...obviously,
Expendables are uninsurable.</i></b></font>

117
00:08:36,767 --> 00:08:41,230
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>There's no workers' comp,
no unions, no pension benefits.</i></b></font>

118
00:08:41,897 --> 00:08:44,982
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Now, I wouldn't be surprised
if you were thinking at this point,</i></b></font>

119
00:08:44,983 --> 00:08:48,028
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>"Well then, why-- why did you
do this to yourself?"</i></b></font>

120
00:08:48,695 --> 00:08:51,948
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Well, because I had a friend who told me</i></b></font>

121
00:08:51,949 --> 00:08:56,537
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>that one day macarons
would sell better than burgers.</i></b></font>

122
00:08:58,038 --> 00:09:02,875
{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And because I trusted this shitty friend,
and I got an enormous loan</i></b></font>

123
00:09:02,876 --> 00:09:07,631
{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>from a wonderful gentleman
to open a macaron store.</i></b></font>

124
00:09:18,767 --> 00:09:22,228
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, shit.</b></font>

125
00:09:40,414 --> 00:09:42,498
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right, all right,</b></font>

126
00:09:42,499 --> 00:09:43,834
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>calm down.</b></font>

127
00:09:44,418 --> 00:09:46,420
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm well aware
that you have four weeks left.</b></font>

128
00:09:46,545 --> 00:09:48,714
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Just think of this as a little field trip.</b></font>

129
00:09:48,964 --> 00:09:50,673
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A taste of what may unfold</b></font>

130
00:09:50,674 --> 00:09:53,176
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>should you fail to reimburse us
in a timely manner.</b></font>

131
00:09:53,177 --> 00:09:56,470
{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Besides, you two have
a lot of time on your hands,</b></font>

132
00:09:56,471 --> 00:09:59,974
{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>with your little macaron shop gone under.</b></font>

133
00:09:59,975 --> 00:10:02,935
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is quite a show
you got on here for me, quite a show.</b></font>

134
00:10:02,936 --> 00:10:05,313
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The message is clear, I hear you.
I hear it loud and clear,</b></font>

135
00:10:05,314 --> 00:10:06,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>"I'm late. I'm late. The money is late."</b></font>

136
00:10:06,732 --> 00:10:08,149
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's coming. Two people behind...</b></font>

137
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:12,236
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Darius Blank.
A name I wish I'd never heard.</i></b></font>

138
00:10:12,237 --> 00:10:16,073
{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mr. Blank isn't all that concerned
with money.</b></font>

139
00:10:16,074 --> 00:10:17,783
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>He has plenty.</b></font>

140
00:10:17,784 --> 00:10:20,120
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This building's just one
of his many assets.</b></font>

141
00:10:21,038 --> 00:10:23,289
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Watching his delinquent borrowers die,</b></font>

142
00:10:23,290 --> 00:10:25,458
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>savoring the details of death...</b></font>

143
00:10:25,459 --> 00:10:27,669
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>that, he truly enjoys.</b></font>

144
00:10:27,794 --> 00:10:30,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The message is clear. You can stop now.
We can stop, you know?</b></font>

145
00:10:30,005 --> 00:10:31,797
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's-- It's... I hear you.</b></font>

146
00:10:31,798 --> 00:10:34,217
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You know, two weeks,
two weeks is all it takes.</b></font>

147
00:10:34,218 --> 00:10:36,511
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All it takes now.
A-A-And more is coming,</b></font>

148
00:10:36,512 --> 00:10:37,845
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>there's more coming, more money is...</b></font>

149
00:10:37,846 --> 00:10:40,056
{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>More money is, is, is...</b></font>

150
00:10:48,524 --> 00:10:52,568
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We caught that gentleman four days ago
in Ulaanbaatar, Mongolia.</b></font>

151
00:10:52,569 --> 00:10:53,946
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Looks expensive.</b></font>

152
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:58,616
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Rest assured,
anyone who misses the deadline,</b></font>

153
00:10:58,617 --> 00:11:00,869
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>we chase them to the ends of the Earth.</b></font>

154
00:11:02,162 --> 00:11:04,997
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So we decided
to get off of Earth.</i></b></font>

155
00:11:04,998 --> 00:11:10,546
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Nothing was working out,
and I got no family relying on me.</i></b></font>

156
00:11:10,671 --> 00:11:12,797
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So, I applied to the colony expedition,</i></b></font>

157
00:11:12,798 --> 00:11:15,800
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>but there's, like, a million other people
with the same idea.</i></b></font>

158
00:11:15,801 --> 00:11:17,635
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Seems like the whole of this rotten planet</i></b></font>

159
00:11:17,636 --> 00:11:19,053
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>was running away from something.</i></b></font>

160
00:11:19,054 --> 00:11:21,722
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I guess everybody's got money problems.</i></b></font>

161
00:11:21,723 --> 00:11:24,225
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But anyway, we had to get on this ship,</i></b></font>

162
00:11:24,226 --> 00:11:26,227
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>because it was the last one of the season.</i></b></font>

163
00:11:27,229 --> 00:11:30,064
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Waves upon waves of people
desperate to leave Earth.</b></font>

164
00:11:30,065 --> 00:11:33,442
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's clear anti-migrationists
are talking to a brick wall</b></font>

165
00:11:33,443 --> 00:11:35,778
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>when they insist on fixing up the Earth,</b></font>

166
00:11:35,779 --> 00:11:40,199
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>instead of risking lives
by migrating to another planet.</b></font>

167
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,952
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It feels like these passionate applicants</b></font>

168
00:11:42,953 --> 00:11:45,037
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>are already off in space.</b></font>

169
00:11:45,038 --> 00:11:47,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>More importantly, this is the expedition</b></font>

170
00:11:47,291 --> 00:11:50,502
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>led by former congressman,
Kenneth Marshall,</b></font>

171
00:11:50,627 --> 00:11:53,462
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>who lost his last two elections.</b></font>

172
00:11:53,463 --> 00:11:55,173
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is this failed politician</b></font>

173
00:11:55,174 --> 00:11:58,843
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>now trying to establish
a kingdom beyond the stars?</b></font>

174
00:11:58,844 --> 00:12:01,345
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is it his fanatical supporters</b></font>

175
00:12:01,346 --> 00:12:03,264
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>who won him a generous sponsorship</b></font>

176
00:12:03,265 --> 00:12:06,976
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>from a particular religious
organization and corporation?</b></font>

177
00:12:06,977 --> 00:12:09,395
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So many questions left unanswered.</b></font>

178
00:12:09,396 --> 00:12:11,147
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's go and talk to the crowd.</b></font>

179
00:12:11,148 --> 00:12:14,233
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Excuse me, are you
a Kenneth Marshall supporter?</b></font>

180
00:12:14,234 --> 00:12:16,152
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am. I am, big time.</b></font>

181
00:12:16,153 --> 00:12:17,862
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I am a full-on supporter.</b></font>

182
00:12:17,863 --> 00:12:19,906
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I basically am the one and only.</b></font>

183
00:12:19,907 --> 00:12:21,908
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are you from
M-Marshall's official channel?</b></font>

184
00:12:21,909 --> 00:12:23,743
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- I'm from EC 20--
- No way.</b></font>

185
00:12:23,744 --> 00:12:25,620
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So Marshall's watching this right now?</b></font>

186
00:12:25,621 --> 00:12:27,079
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Oh, my God!
- You need to pick me.</b></font>

187
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:29,291
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I swear, please pick me.</b></font>

188
00:12:29,708 --> 00:12:32,461
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You need people young
and healthy for the expedition.</b></font>

189
00:12:32,586 --> 00:12:36,005
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Ladies and gentlemen,
we have another mild sandstorm today.</i></b></font>

190
00:12:36,006 --> 00:12:38,549
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Access is now restricted to gate three.</i></b></font>

191
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:41,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Please visit our stand
for discounted goggles and masks.</i></b></font>

192
00:12:41,553 --> 00:12:45,139
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Additional five percent off
with Marshall Pay, as always.</i></b></font>

193
00:12:45,140 --> 00:12:47,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>The other expeditions wouldn't take me,</b></font>

194
00:12:47,726 --> 00:12:48,768
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but they're wrong, I promise.</b></font>

195
00:12:48,769 --> 00:12:52,355
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can fix toilets. I make gingerbread.
You gotta take me, give me a shot.</b></font>

196
00:12:52,356 --> 00:12:54,732
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Take us to the clean star,
Marshall and Ylfa.</b></font>

197
00:12:54,733 --> 00:12:56,359
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Take me with you!</b></font>

198
00:13:02,616 --> 00:13:04,117
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Expendable.</b></font>

199
00:13:04,993 --> 00:13:06,787
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're applying to be an Expendable?</b></font>

200
00:13:07,412 --> 00:13:08,622
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Seriously?</b></font>

201
00:13:10,249 --> 00:13:12,125
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You read through the whole application?</b></font>

202
00:13:13,293 --> 00:13:15,586
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

203
00:13:15,587 --> 00:13:17,506
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I should have read through it.</i></b></font>

204
00:13:17,881 --> 00:13:20,132
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I mean, I didn't have
too much of a choice.</i></b></font>

205
00:13:20,133 --> 00:13:23,554
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I don't have any bona fide certifications.</i></b></font>

206
00:13:24,555 --> 00:13:26,890
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I don't really have any skills whatsoever.</i></b></font>

207
00:13:29,142 --> 00:13:31,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Then I find out Timo's already called dibs</i></b></font>

208
00:13:31,645 --> 00:13:35,023
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>on a position for himself,
as a flitter pilot.</i></b></font>

209
00:13:35,148 --> 00:13:38,026
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>He only just got his learner's
permit a couple of weeks before.</i></b></font>

210
00:13:39,611 --> 00:13:42,613
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>No idea what he had to come up with
to pull that off,</i></b></font>

211
00:13:42,614 --> 00:13:44,199
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>but you gotta give it to him.</i></b></font>

212
00:13:45,325 --> 00:13:48,202
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Excuse me.</b></font>

213
00:13:48,203 --> 00:13:51,622
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is there, like, some construction
going on?</b></font>

214
00:13:51,623 --> 00:13:52,999
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Sorry, what?</b></font>

215
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,918
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You don't hear like a...</b></font>

216
00:13:56,336 --> 00:13:58,422
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>...like a ch-chain saw?</b></font>

217
00:13:59,381 --> 00:14:01,383
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, no.</b></font>

218
00:14:02,342 --> 00:14:04,343
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I wanted to get
the hell outta there.</i></b></font>

219
00:14:04,344 --> 00:14:07,264
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Somewhere where the sound
couldn't follow me.</i></b></font>

220
00:14:08,056 --> 00:14:09,725
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Far out into space.</i></b></font>

221
00:14:11,977 --> 00:14:13,520
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You read through the paperwork?</b></font>

222
00:14:14,021 --> 00:14:15,062
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes.</b></font>

223
00:14:15,063 --> 00:14:16,898
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You read it, so you know, right?</b></font>

224
00:14:16,899 --> 00:14:19,442
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is gonna be a pretty extreme job.</b></font>

225
00:14:19,443 --> 00:14:21,862
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But it's also gonna be fun.</b></font>

226
00:14:22,571 --> 00:14:24,488
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'll explain all the details.</b></font>

227
00:14:24,489 --> 00:14:27,825
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I got so distracted
by that smell, uh,</i></b></font>

228
00:14:27,826 --> 00:14:30,453
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>the smell of this woman's hair.</i></b></font>

229
00:14:30,454 --> 00:14:34,499
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It was like it brought back
some far away memory, or something.</i></b></font>

230
00:14:35,250 --> 00:14:38,212
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That giant tank downstairs
is called a cycler.</b></font>

231
00:14:38,337 --> 00:14:41,756
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It takes organic waste produced
in the spaceship,</b></font>

232
00:14:41,757 --> 00:14:44,759
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>apple peels, chicken bones, rotten eggs,</b></font>

233
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:47,428
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>dead bodies, human waste, you name it...</b></font>

234
00:14:47,429 --> 00:14:50,932
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>then it combines, refines,
and recycles them</b></font>

235
00:14:50,933 --> 00:14:55,019
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and sends a portion to this printer.</b></font>

236
00:14:55,020 --> 00:14:57,397
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Raw materials for a human body.</b></font>

237
00:14:58,190 --> 00:14:59,982
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Once you die, and the Committee approves,</b></font>

238
00:14:59,983 --> 00:15:03,195
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>it'll print a new version of your body
within 20 hours.</b></font>

239
00:15:04,905 --> 00:15:07,658
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Take your clothes off, change into this.</b></font>

240
00:15:09,201 --> 00:15:11,327
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I couldn't even hear
anything she was saying.</i></b></font>

241
00:15:11,328 --> 00:15:15,666
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It was like all of my senses
were focused on my nose.</i></b></font>

242
00:15:16,708 --> 00:15:20,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Like, real déjà vu, but for a smell.</i></b></font>

243
00:15:22,089 --> 00:15:25,216
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>We're going to do a full scan
of your biodata.</b></font>

244
00:15:25,217 --> 00:15:28,387
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That means you'll be reprinted
exactly as you are right now.</b></font>

245
00:15:29,012 --> 00:15:30,264
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Forever.</b></font>

246
00:15:31,181 --> 00:15:33,683
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I better pop this.</b></font>

247
00:15:33,684 --> 00:15:35,769
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Otherwise, it will be there every time.</b></font>

248
00:15:39,523 --> 00:15:41,023
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Well, I'm glad she didn't know</i></b></font>

249
00:15:41,024 --> 00:15:42,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>about the one on my butt.</i></b></font>

250
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:49,365
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So, after she does the body scan,</i></b></font>

251
00:15:49,366 --> 00:15:51,325
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>she uploaded my memories.</i></b></font>

252
00:15:51,326 --> 00:15:54,245
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Called it a "personality backup."</i></b></font>

253
00:15:54,246 --> 00:15:55,788
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And I gotta do this once a week,</i></b></font>

254
00:15:55,789 --> 00:15:58,750
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>so I don't have any big gaps
every time they print me out.</i></b></font>

255
00:15:59,042 --> 00:16:01,044
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>In the past,
you would have needed</b></font>

256
00:16:01,170 --> 00:16:03,754
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>a hard drive the size of
a commercial refrigerator</b></font>

257
00:16:03,755 --> 00:16:05,339
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to copy an adult brain.</b></font>

258
00:16:05,340 --> 00:16:08,302
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Now, this little brick.
Clever, right?</b></font>

259
00:16:09,887 --> 00:16:11,554
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So, I was injected with some</i></b></font>

260
00:16:11,555 --> 00:16:13,306
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>special solution.</i></b></font>

261
00:16:13,307 --> 00:16:16,143
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It brought back a flood of old memories.</i></b></font>

262
00:16:16,935 --> 00:16:19,229
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Too many memories.</i></b></font>

263
00:16:23,025 --> 00:16:25,360
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We were heading home
from the supermarket.</i></b></font>

264
00:16:25,485 --> 00:16:27,905
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I asked to sit in the front seat.</i></b></font>

265
00:16:28,572 --> 00:16:30,239
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I said, "I'm big enough."</i></b></font>

266
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:32,701
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And that's when I saw the red button.</i></b></font>

267
00:16:33,243 --> 00:16:35,495
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I just pressed it and she crashed.</i></b></font>

268
00:17:08,487 --> 00:17:11,531
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Put it to your head and pull the trigger.</b></font>

269
00:17:12,199 --> 00:17:14,825
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is the final requirement
to become an Expendable.</b></font>

270
00:17:16,036 --> 00:17:18,204
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Prove to me you have faith in the system.</b></font>

271
00:17:19,957 --> 00:17:22,376
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>From now on,
you need to get used to dying.</b></font>

272
00:17:23,001 --> 00:17:24,377
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>This is your job.</b></font>

273
00:17:47,693 --> 00:17:49,902
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I began
the four-and-a-half year journey</i></b></font>

274
00:17:49,903 --> 00:17:51,196
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>as Mickey 1.</i></b></font>

275
00:17:54,658 --> 00:17:57,452
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>When you're stuck in a spaceship
for that long,</i></b></font>

276
00:17:57,870 --> 00:18:00,247
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>food is everything.</i></b></font>

277
00:18:01,331 --> 00:18:03,499
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Warning, Mickey 1.</i></b></font>

278
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:06,879
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Seven calories over
the current ration allocation.</i></b></font>

279
00:18:18,891 --> 00:18:21,601
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>On that first day
in the cafeteria,</i></b></font>

280
00:18:21,602 --> 00:18:24,896
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I think I might have started thinking,</i></b></font>

281
00:18:24,897 --> 00:18:27,231
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>"What have I done?" a little.</i></b></font>

282
00:18:27,232 --> 00:18:30,359
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The whole room was full of people
eating this crappy food,</i></b></font>

283
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:34,155
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>and there's total silence, like,
you could hear a pin drop.</i></b></font>

284
00:18:34,156 --> 00:18:39,827
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Until, Kenneth Marshall
and his wife, Ylfa, walk in.</i></b></font>

285
00:18:40,913 --> 00:18:44,749
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And a whole bunch of people
just started going nuts.</i></b></font>

286
00:18:55,844 --> 00:18:58,763
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I was thinking,
"What the hell am I doing here?"</i></b></font>

287
00:19:03,852 --> 00:19:05,854
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But that's when I saw her.</i></b></font>

288
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:08,398
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Nasha.</i></b></font>

289
00:19:10,776 --> 00:19:13,612
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>That was the first time
I saw Nasha Barridge.</i></b></font>

290
00:19:17,491 --> 00:19:20,118
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>On day one in this long journey.</i></b></font>

291
00:20:12,713 --> 00:20:15,632
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Speech! Speech! Speech! Speech!</b></font>

292
00:20:17,718 --> 00:20:19,887
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right, enough. Enough.</b></font>

293
00:20:21,388 --> 00:20:24,932
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Keep that up for one minute
and you waste five calories.</b></font>

294
00:20:24,933 --> 00:20:28,854
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's two percent of the precious meal
you're eating right now.</b></font>

295
00:20:29,229 --> 00:20:31,480
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>As you know, our number one priority</i></b></font>

296
