1652
01:41:39,349 --> 01:41:40,017
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Come.</b></font>

1653
01:41:40,642 --> 01:41:43,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Let's go.
- Well, I...</b></font>

1654
01:41:47,608 --> 01:41:54,031
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, anyway, with this device,
I got a job to do.</b></font>

1655
01:41:55,532 --> 01:41:59,536
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All right. They saved me,
now I save them.</b></font>

1656
01:42:00,162 --> 01:42:02,246
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What are those fuckers doing?</b></font>

1657
01:42:02,247 --> 01:42:05,416
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Even I can count dozens of fresh
tails they're leaving behind.</b></font>

1658
01:42:05,417 --> 01:42:07,044
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Are they out of their minds?</b></font>

1659
01:42:07,794 --> 01:42:09,545
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, honey.</b></font>

1660
01:42:09,546 --> 01:42:12,674
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Should I just press the button?
- Mmm.</b></font>

1661
01:42:13,217 --> 01:42:15,552
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Let's sit back and watch.</b></font>

1662
01:42:16,720 --> 01:42:18,679
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They'll start chopping tails
as soon as they realize</b></font>

1663
01:42:18,680 --> 01:42:21,432
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>one of them
has to outlive the other.</b></font>

1664
01:42:22,809 --> 01:42:23,894
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey!</b></font>

1665
01:42:25,187 --> 01:42:27,147
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's me! Wait!</b></font>

1666
01:42:28,649 --> 01:42:32,110
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You gotta run away.
You gotta get them all outta here.</b></font>

1667
01:42:32,778 --> 01:42:34,363
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You gotta go back to your cave.</b></font>

1668
01:42:35,072 --> 01:42:38,241
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go back to your cave.</b></font>

1669
01:42:41,620 --> 01:42:43,454
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Or you're all gonna die.</b></font>

1670
01:42:45,541 --> 01:42:46,542
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>What?</i></b></font>

1671
01:42:47,209 --> 01:42:47,960
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, hello.</b></font>

1672
01:42:49,878 --> 01:42:50,963
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Um...</b></font>

1673
01:42:51,797 --> 01:42:55,342
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, I just, I wanted...
About last time, I...</b></font>

1674
01:42:58,136 --> 01:43:01,055
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I wanted to say thank you.</b></font>

1675
01:43:01,056 --> 01:43:02,516
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Um...</b></font>

1676
01:43:03,809 --> 01:43:05,644
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You remember me, right?</b></font>

1677
01:43:07,604 --> 01:43:08,939
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Mickey.</i></b></font>

1678
01:43:11,775 --> 01:43:13,569
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How do you know my name?</b></font>

1679
01:43:16,530 --> 01:43:17,990
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Secret.</i></b></font>

1680
01:43:19,032 --> 01:43:21,243
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wait, are they
having a conversation?</b></font>

1681
01:43:22,578 --> 01:43:25,580
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes. We already explained it just now.</b></font>

1682
01:43:25,581 --> 01:43:27,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>How is this possible?</b></font>

1683
01:43:27,291 --> 01:43:29,960
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, it's still a prototype,</b></font>

1684
01:43:30,085 --> 01:43:33,129
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but it's like a translator device.</b></font>

1685
01:43:33,130 --> 01:43:36,257
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Dorothy? Oh, no.
Where's Dorothy?</b></font>

1686
01:43:36,258 --> 01:43:38,926
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I can't hear a thing with all this static.</b></font>

1687
01:43:38,927 --> 01:43:40,929
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I mean, even the video is shit.</b></font>

1688
01:43:41,597 --> 01:43:44,849
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Apologies, sir. The snowstorm
is exacerbating the absorption--</b></font>

1689
01:43:44,850 --> 01:43:47,476
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What about this?
Will this detonator work?</b></font>

1690
01:43:47,477 --> 01:43:49,645
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, sir. That is a special
shortwave signal,</b></font>

1691
01:43:49,646 --> 01:43:50,563
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>so it'll be fine.</b></font>

1692
01:43:50,564 --> 01:43:53,024
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And who's that big one there?</b></font>

1693
01:43:53,025 --> 01:43:54,233
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Is that the queen bee of the bunch?</b></font>

1694
01:43:54,234 --> 01:43:57,028
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mmm. Looks like a croissant
dipped in shit.</b></font>

1695
01:43:57,029 --> 01:44:01,115
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, official reports
are still being finalized,</b></font>

1696
01:44:01,116 --> 01:44:04,160
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but we think everything revolves
around that one,</b></font>

1697
01:44:04,161 --> 01:44:05,829
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>the Mama Creeper.</b></font>

1698
01:44:05,954 --> 01:44:08,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, that one's the boss.
Like you.</b></font>

1699
01:44:10,375 --> 01:44:11,919
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Say what?</i></b></font>

1700
01:44:12,044 --> 01:44:14,212
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You gotta get outta here,</b></font>

1701
01:44:14,213 --> 01:44:16,882
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>or they're gonna kill you
all with this death gas.</b></font>

1702
01:44:18,091 --> 01:44:22,553
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That gas, Arkady 3.0,
I got blasted with that.</b></font>

1703
01:44:22,554 --> 01:44:25,724
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's seriously, insanely painful.</b></font>

1704
01:44:27,684 --> 01:44:31,188
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do you know what gas is?
Gas. Like...</b></font>

1705
01:44:32,189 --> 01:44:34,525
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Like gas?</b></font>

1706
01:44:37,819 --> 01:44:40,530
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Mind your own business, stupid.</i></b></font>

1707
01:44:40,531 --> 01:44:44,034
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mind my own business?
What about you?</b></font>

1708
01:44:45,035 --> 01:44:47,079
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Why'd you save him at the cave?</b></font>

1709
01:44:49,915 --> 01:44:51,750
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Should kill him?</i></b></font>

1710
01:44:52,167 --> 01:44:54,086
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>No. No.</b></font>

1711
01:44:55,170 --> 01:44:58,674
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm-- We're very grateful.
That's all.</b></font>

1712
01:44:59,424 --> 01:45:00,676
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Then why?</i></b></font>

1713
01:45:03,554 --> 01:45:05,055
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Why kill Luco?</i></b></font>

1714
01:45:06,139 --> 01:45:08,684
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, Luco?</b></font>

1715
01:45:10,936 --> 01:45:13,272
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Baby Luco.</i></b></font>

1716
01:45:14,648 --> 01:45:15,649
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh.</b></font>

1717
01:45:17,818 --> 01:45:21,613
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You group. Shattered.</i></b></font>

1718
01:45:22,698 --> 01:45:23,739
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Blood.</i></b></font>

1719
01:45:23,740 --> 01:45:24,992
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yeah...</b></font>

1720
01:45:25,534 --> 01:45:26,577
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, that's...</b></font>

1721
01:45:27,578 --> 01:45:28,579
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>That's Luco.</b></font>

1722
01:45:30,706 --> 01:45:32,499
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We save you.</i></b></font>

1723
01:45:35,085 --> 01:45:38,463
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>You kill Luco.</i></b></font>

1724
01:45:43,093 --> 01:45:45,971
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, what's the name of the other baby?
The one in the ship.</b></font>

1725
01:45:46,847 --> 01:45:49,266
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Zoco.</i></b></font>

1726
01:45:50,350 --> 01:45:53,604
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Kill Zoco too?</i></b></font>

1727
01:45:54,104 --> 01:45:58,275
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What if Zoco dies?
What will you do?</b></font>

1728
01:46:00,694 --> 01:46:02,029
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Death.</i></b></font>

1729
01:46:02,696 --> 01:46:04,072
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>All.</i></b></font>

1730
01:46:07,618 --> 01:46:09,369
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You mean all humans.</b></font>

1731
01:46:13,457 --> 01:46:15,959
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>- Extinction.</i>
- How?</b></font>

1732
01:46:17,294 --> 01:46:19,880
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Easy.</i></b></font>

1733
01:47:01,588 --> 01:47:05,550
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Cover your ear.</i></b></font>

1734
01:47:05,551 --> 01:47:08,595
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But eyeball explode.</i></b></font>

1735
01:47:11,640 --> 01:47:13,517
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Brain explode.</i></b></font>

1736
01:47:16,103 --> 01:47:17,562
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>All of you.</i></b></font>

1737
01:47:24,695 --> 01:47:25,904
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nasha!</b></font>

1738
01:47:26,655 --> 01:47:27,656
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nasha!</b></font>

1739
01:47:34,371 --> 01:47:35,581
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nasha!</b></font>

1740
01:47:36,039 --> 01:47:38,292
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Nasha! Look at me!</b></font>

1741
01:47:39,668 --> 01:47:40,919
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Look at my mouth.</b></font>

1742
01:47:43,589 --> 01:47:46,215
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What's wrong with them?
What's wrong with him?</b></font>

1743
01:47:46,216 --> 01:47:49,302
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And they're saying something.
What is that idiot saying?</b></font>

1744
01:47:49,303 --> 01:47:51,555
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's not sign language.</b></font>

1745
01:47:51,972 --> 01:47:53,515
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>C3!</b></font>

1746
01:47:54,057 --> 01:47:55,475
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>C3!</b></font>

1747
01:47:59,688 --> 01:48:02,023
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>C... 3?</b></font>

1748
01:48:02,024 --> 01:48:03,357
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>3?</b></font>

1749
01:48:03,358 --> 01:48:05,694
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>C3? What's C3?</b></font>

1750
01:48:05,819 --> 01:48:06,819
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>C3?</b></font>

1751
01:48:15,120 --> 01:48:15,912
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Bring the baby.</b></font>

1752
01:48:15,913 --> 01:48:17,414
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Bring the baby.</i></b></font>

1753
01:48:17,831 --> 01:48:20,166
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Bring the baby.</b></font>

1754
01:48:20,167 --> 01:48:21,960
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>If we don't bring her back,</i></b></font>

1755
01:48:22,669 --> 01:48:24,420
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>we're all gonna die.</i></b></font>

1756
01:48:24,421 --> 01:48:26,047
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Honey, this doesn't sit well with me.</b></font>

1757
01:48:26,048 --> 01:48:27,840
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Why are those two losers chatting</b></font>

1758
01:48:27,841 --> 01:48:28,966
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>with the boss of the bugs?</b></font>

1759
01:48:28,967 --> 01:48:30,301
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>They think they're negotiating</b></font>

1760
01:48:30,302 --> 01:48:32,053
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>on behalf of mankind--
humankind?</b></font>

1761
01:48:32,054 --> 01:48:34,388
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You should be standing out there, sir,</b></font>

1762
01:48:34,389 --> 01:48:36,850
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>ushering in this historic moment.</b></font>

1763
01:48:37,684 --> 01:48:40,353
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're seeing two bosses meeting</b></font>

1764
01:48:40,354 --> 01:48:43,022
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>face to face
in a climactic snowstorm?</b></font>

1765
01:48:43,023 --> 01:48:44,273
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A moment of destiny?</b></font>

1766
01:48:44,274 --> 01:48:46,317
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>All you have to do
is go out there.</b></font>

1767
01:48:46,318 --> 01:48:48,236
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I know I can create an iconic scene.</b></font>

1768
01:48:48,237 --> 01:48:51,614
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A decisive moment in the history
of the Niflheim settlement.</b></font>

1769
01:48:51,615 --> 01:48:53,742
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>- Bring the baby.
- I can picture it now.</b></font>

1770
01:48:53,867 --> 01:48:57,036
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Adorning the ceiling and
the walls of the grand chapel.</b></font>

1771
01:48:57,037 --> 01:48:58,914
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, ma'am, yes.</b></font>

1772
01:48:59,623 --> 01:49:01,958
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>And one final touch, sir.</b></font>

1773
01:49:01,959 --> 01:49:04,169
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I think it would be great
if you give them a message</b></font>

1774
01:49:04,294 --> 01:49:05,837
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>before spraying the gas.</b></font>

1775
01:49:05,838 --> 01:49:06,922
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A message?</b></font>

1776
01:49:07,339 --> 01:49:10,341
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Without such poignancy, today
would be a third-rate carnival</b></font>

1777
01:49:10,342 --> 01:49:13,761
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>where we spray cheap pesticide
over cockroaches.</b></font>

1778
01:49:13,762 --> 01:49:17,640
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, they are disgusting,
filthy, evil insects,</b></font>

1779
01:49:17,641 --> 01:49:19,517
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>but it will be their last moment,</b></font>

1780
01:49:19,518 --> 01:49:22,103
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>and you could offer them
a few merciful words</b></font>

1781
01:49:22,104 --> 01:49:26,733
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>as a proper farewell,
like a wise, benevolent priest.</b></font>

1782
01:49:27,025 --> 01:49:28,401
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Get me a camera crew.</b></font>

1783
01:49:28,402 --> 01:49:30,111
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Tell the first squad
to meet me fully armed.</b></font>

1784
01:49:30,112 --> 01:49:30,945
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Yes, sir.</b></font>

1785
01:49:30,946 --> 01:49:34,283
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>My love, the Situation Room
is yours. Till we meet again.</b></font>

1786
01:49:38,996 --> 01:49:41,581
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>C3. Nasha will know
what it means.</b></font>

1787
01:49:41,582 --> 01:49:42,958
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's a whole thing.</b></font>

1788
01:49:43,917 --> 01:49:46,837
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I'm gonna get Zoco back safe.
I mean it.</b></font>

1789
01:49:49,131 --> 01:49:50,465
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Not enough.</i></b></font>

1790
01:49:51,967 --> 01:49:53,426
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What else?</b></font>

1791
01:49:54,845 --> 01:49:56,762
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>We lose Luco.</i></b></font>

1792
01:49:58,098 --> 01:49:59,223
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>One.</i></b></font>

1793
01:49:59,224 --> 01:50:01,560
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Be fair.</i></b></font>

1794
01:50:02,603 --> 01:50:05,856
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Be fair? Like we have
to contribute a death?</b></font>

1795
01:50:07,274 --> 01:50:08,317
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Yes.</i></b></font>

1796
01:50:09,484 --> 01:50:10,652
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Fair.</i></b></font>

1797
01:50:11,528 --> 01:50:14,864
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>One of yours. Die.</i></b></font>

1798
01:50:14,865 --> 01:50:18,576
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>So, if we bring back Zoco safe,
and a human dies...</b></font>

1799
01:50:18,577 --> 01:50:21,705
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Peace.</i></b></font>

1800
01:50:37,012 --> 01:50:37,930
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Drive.</b></font>

1801
01:50:52,027 --> 01:50:53,319
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You hear me?</b></font>

1802
01:50:53,320 --> 01:50:55,614
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Camera crew, unit three,
do you copy?</b></font>

1803
01:50:56,448 --> 01:50:58,950
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay, the radio signal's
a little patchy right now,</b></font>

1804
01:50:58,951 --> 01:51:01,702
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>so the car speaker will be
