02:01:16,527 --> 02:01:18,778
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The day
Marshall got blown to dust,</i></b></font>

1958
02:01:18,779 --> 02:01:21,698
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Ylfa went into shock
and was taken to the psych ward.</i></b></font>

1959
02:01:22,115 --> 02:01:25,326
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Rumors went around
that she slit her wrists there.</i></b></font>

1960
02:01:25,327 --> 02:01:27,954
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Everyone else involved
was shoved into jail.</i></b></font>

1961
02:01:27,955 --> 02:01:30,707
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And somehow lucky Timo
squeezes out on parole.</i></b></font>

1962
02:01:32,626 --> 02:01:33,877
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But as soon as he got out,</i></b></font>

1963
02:01:34,002 --> 02:01:35,419
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>he spent every day
dreading the moment</i></b></font>

1964
02:01:35,420 --> 02:01:36,629
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>he'd come face to face</i></b></font>

1965
02:01:36,630 --> 02:01:38,340
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>with the man
who delivered the letter.</i></b></font>

1966
02:01:39,049 --> 02:01:43,720
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>The associate of Darius Blank,
who one day finally jumped him.</i></b></font>

1967
02:01:47,140 --> 02:01:48,809
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It was a fight to the death.</i></b></font>

1968
02:01:49,852 --> 02:01:51,019
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>In the end,</i></b></font>

1969
02:01:51,728 --> 02:01:54,731
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>the associate
became, uh, cycler soup.</i></b></font>

1970
02:01:57,442 --> 02:01:59,111
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Except for one ear.</i></b></font>

1971
02:02:01,029 --> 02:02:04,740
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Even at the trial,
Timo chooses to represent himself.</i></b></font>

1972
02:02:06,201 --> 02:02:08,494
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>As he had his grip on me,
he brought his knife around</b></font>

1973
02:02:08,495 --> 02:02:11,080
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to my mid-section right here,
and he sliced...</b></font>

1974
02:02:11,081 --> 02:02:14,375
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And he got
released on self-defense.</i></b></font>

1975
02:02:14,376 --> 02:02:15,878
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Classic Timo.</i></b></font>

1976
02:02:16,503 --> 02:02:19,380
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But our trials on the other
hand, were never-ending.</i></b></font>

1977
02:02:19,381 --> 02:02:21,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Damien, sit down! Sit down!</b></font>

1978
02:02:21,842 --> 02:02:25,511
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Became a whole political fight
between all the pro-Marshalls</i></b></font>

1979
02:02:25,512 --> 02:02:28,097
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>and the anti-Marshalls.</i></b></font>

1980
02:02:28,098 --> 02:02:30,933
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But by then,
Nasha had made up her mind.</i></b></font>

1981
02:02:30,934 --> 02:02:34,187
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>She'd overhaul the Committee,
and change it herself.</i></b></font>

1982
02:02:34,188 --> 02:02:37,858
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>So after she got out, she really
did run in the election.</i></b></font>

1983
02:02:38,817 --> 02:02:41,069
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>And she won in a landslide.</i></b></font>

1984
02:02:42,404 --> 02:02:44,405
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>On her first day in the assembly,</i></b></font>

1985
02:02:44,406 --> 02:02:47,117
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Nasha was so cool
about the whole thing.</i></b></font>

1986
02:02:49,161 --> 02:02:51,747
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I was very, very nervous.</i></b></font>

1987
02:02:52,247 --> 02:02:54,249
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I don't think
she really noticed, though.</i></b></font>

1988
02:02:56,251 --> 02:03:00,339
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mickey. I've got the upgraded translator.
Just came out.</b></font>

1989
02:03:03,926 --> 02:03:06,385
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Okay, let's be fair,
can I ask you a question?</b></font>

1990
02:03:08,347 --> 02:03:09,264
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Go.</i></b></font>

1991
02:03:09,890 --> 02:03:11,475
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What you said before,</b></font>

1992
02:03:11,975 --> 02:03:15,937
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>about extinction and all that,
when you were all like...</b></font>

1993
02:03:18,315 --> 02:03:20,734
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>...and like screeching
and everything.</b></font>

1994
02:03:21,610 --> 02:03:22,611
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mmm.</b></font>

1995
02:03:24,196 --> 02:03:27,823
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Would that really
make our brains explode?</b></font>

1996
02:03:27,824 --> 02:03:29,868
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>From like the pitch?</b></font>

1997
02:03:32,287 --> 02:03:33,829
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Explode.</i></b></font>

1998
02:03:33,830 --> 02:03:35,457
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>But you said...</b></font>

1999
02:03:35,874 --> 02:03:40,045
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>...that our eyeballs
would explode.</b></font>

2000
02:03:40,879 --> 02:03:43,841
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mmm. Why not our eardrums?</b></font>

2001
02:03:44,341 --> 02:03:46,635
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>'Cause it's like sound.</b></font>

2002
02:03:49,429 --> 02:03:51,389
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>All explode.</i></b></font>

2003
02:03:51,390 --> 02:03:53,308
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Really?</b></font>

2004
02:03:53,976 --> 02:03:56,812
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, can you try it right here?
Right now?</b></font>

2005
02:04:13,871 --> 02:04:16,290
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Who said
bluffing was only for humans?</i></b></font>

2006
02:04:16,832 --> 02:04:19,376
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Gotta love that, uh, poker face.</i></b></font>

2007
02:04:20,210 --> 02:04:23,046
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Yeah and nice burp, too.</i></b></font>

2008
02:05:28,445 --> 02:05:30,239
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Uh, hello.</b></font>

2009
02:05:30,864 --> 02:05:34,242
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What are you doing here?
In the middle of the night.</b></font>

2010
02:05:34,243 --> 02:05:37,745
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Well, I just...</b></font>

2011
02:05:37,746 --> 02:05:39,705
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I thought you were
in the hospital all this time.</b></font>

2012
02:05:39,706 --> 02:05:41,457
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey, watch it. Look down.</b></font>

2013
02:05:41,458 --> 02:05:43,585
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Don't step on it.</b></font>

2014
02:05:46,547 --> 02:05:49,423
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's a priceless delicacy, that.</b></font>

2015
02:05:49,424 --> 02:05:51,676
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go on. Take a dab.</b></font>

2016
02:05:51,677 --> 02:05:53,262
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Have a taste.</b></font>

2017
02:05:56,306 --> 02:05:59,267
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Oh, what? Now you're too good
for sauce off the floor?</b></font>

2018
02:05:59,268 --> 02:06:01,185
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You think anyone else
would allow scum like you</b></font>

2019
02:06:01,186 --> 02:06:02,688
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>to taste something so refined?</b></font>

2020
02:06:03,647 --> 02:06:06,357
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What is-- What is it made of?</b></font>

2021
02:06:06,358 --> 02:06:09,527
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Rude! Not how it works.</b></font>

2022
02:06:09,528 --> 02:06:13,656
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A taste of faith comes first,
then I tell you what's in it.</b></font>

2023
02:06:13,657 --> 02:06:15,408
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mickey, you don't think
I'm letting you taste this</b></font>

2024
02:06:15,409 --> 02:06:18,452
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>out of some high regard
for your palate, do you?</b></font>

2025
02:06:18,453 --> 02:06:20,288
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's the opposite.</b></font>

2026
02:06:20,289 --> 02:06:22,456
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>A true masterpiece
would be a sauce</b></font>

2027
02:06:22,457 --> 02:06:25,502
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>that could appeal to even
an ignorant cretin like you.</b></font>

2028
02:06:33,969 --> 02:06:35,261
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Whatever. Fuck it.</b></font>

2029
02:06:35,262 --> 02:06:36,971
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Taste it, waste it, I don't care.</b></font>

2030
02:06:36,972 --> 02:06:38,306
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You're worthless now.</b></font>

2031
02:06:38,307 --> 02:06:41,392
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Much better to bring back
my usual taster,</b></font>

2032
02:06:41,393 --> 02:06:45,104
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>the supreme one
with an actually refined palate.</b></font>

2033
02:06:47,357 --> 02:06:49,526
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Wait, that's...</b></font>

2034
02:06:51,028 --> 02:06:54,072
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Even his kidneys
are more handsome than you.</b></font>

2035
02:06:57,743 --> 02:07:00,369
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Not this. It can't be.</b></font>

2036
02:07:04,291 --> 02:07:05,751
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Of course it can.</b></font>

2037
02:07:06,460 --> 02:07:09,004
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Admit it, it's what you want.</b></font>

2038
02:07:09,129 --> 02:07:12,758
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>It's what everyone wants.</b></font>

2039
02:07:13,800 --> 02:07:15,385
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Hey Ylfa.</b></font>

2040
02:07:17,137 --> 02:07:19,056
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>I just remembered.</b></font>

2041
02:07:22,142 --> 02:07:25,854
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>You died the day after Marshall.</b></font>

2042
02:07:44,790 --> 02:07:47,543
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Go ahead, touch me.</b></font>

2043
02:07:49,253 --> 02:07:52,089
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>See if I'm ghost or human.</b></font>

2044
02:07:56,677 --> 02:08:01,222
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>Ever since I was a kid,
I've had scary dreams.</i></b></font>

2045
02:08:01,223 --> 02:08:03,642
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>This time I wasn't scared.</i></b></font>

2046
02:08:04,351 --> 02:08:05,853
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I just thought to myself,</i></b></font>

2047
02:08:06,478 --> 02:08:08,355
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>"What would 18 do?"</i></b></font>

2048
02:08:09,773 --> 02:08:11,107
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Fuck off.</b></font>

2049
02:08:12,442 --> 02:08:14,193
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>What are you doing?
Press the button.</b></font>

2050
02:08:14,194 --> 02:08:16,321
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mickey. Press it.</b></font>

2051
02:08:17,739 --> 02:08:18,782
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Do it.</b></font>

2052
02:08:27,916 --> 02:08:29,877
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>I am glad the printer's gone,</i></b></font>

2053
02:08:30,043 --> 02:08:32,336
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>but a part of me
can't help feeling guilty</i></b></font>

2054
02:08:32,337 --> 02:08:36,424
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>that I didn't let all the other Mickeys
have a chance at life.</i></b></font>

2055
02:08:36,425 --> 02:08:38,384
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>But I have to stop feeling guilty.</i></b></font>

2056
02:08:38,385 --> 02:08:39,845
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b>Mickey!</b></font>

2057
02:08:40,179 --> 02:08:42,347
<font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#fff17d"><b><i>It's okay for me to be happy.</i></b></font>